# | Frequency: ×0.01 Hz.
# | Energy: 64-bit accumulator stored as two consecutive u32 (low word at base, high word at base+2).
# | VT ratio: ×0.1 (e.g. raw 1000 = ratio 100.0); CT ratio: ×1.
